{"3183760":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SpeedRunners 2: King of Speed","steam_appid":3183760,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5096980],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.poster.avif?t=1789420290\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.webm?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.mp4?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your friendships via local multiplayer or compete with runners worldwide in this sequel to the acclaimed competitive platformer – now with up to 8 players per online lobby, upgraded netcode, new characters and power-ups, high-stakes elimination tournaments, explosive story campaign, and a variety of new multiplayer modes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOTTA GO FAST<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.poster.avif?t=1789420290\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.webm?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.mp4?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the movement: build momentum, swing with a grappling hook, and outmaneuver opponents using speed boosters, shortcuts, and traps scattered across maps.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOOLS OF DESTRUCTION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.poster.avif?t=1789420290\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.webm?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.mp4?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash an arsenal of power-ups, featuring fan-favorites like fireballs, freeze rays, and golden hooks alongside new additions like blasters and portable teleporters.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE DAY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.poster.avif?t=1789420290\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.webm?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.mp4?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save New Rush City, meet new and returning heroes, and gear up for multiplayer mayhem in a campaign that expands the original story and lore.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HILARIOUS PVP CHAOS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.poster.avif?t=1789420290\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.webm?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.mp4?t=1789420290\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back in Quick Play, get sweaty in Ranked, compete in brand-new 64-player elimination tournaments, or check out a variety of rule-bending modes in the Playground.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chaotic 2D racing for up to 8 players online<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fluid, high-skill movement system<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 playable characters<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dozens of unlockable cosmetic items<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Expanded arsenal of new and returning power-ups<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 16 map layouts with unique challenges<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Local multiplayer &amp; custom games<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• New experimental, rule-bending modes <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explosive story campaign<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 64-player elimination tournaments<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive Ranked play<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3183760\/extras\/73a3dbb14c69a